41197:If a graphic style is evaluated for the style:writing-mode property of a paragraph as specified in section 16.2, not only the <style:paragraph-properties> element but also the <style:graphic-properties> element is evaluated. If the style:writing-mode attribute is present in both elements, it shall have the same value.
